MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The smart plug feels like a useful next step because it would add voice control to a lamp alongside my connected-home equipment.",
    "The Echo Show 8 fits my interest in home devices by combining a larger screen with Alexa controls; it adds a use beyond the streaming devices I already have."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The HD Fire TV Stick repeats something I already have in a 4K version, so familiarity does not make it useful to buy now.",
    "Earbuds and an in-car assistant do not serve my current home viewing and security interests, while the storage drives assume an upgrade need I have not shown."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My Fire TV purchases seem to have been taken as interest in almost any Alexa device, although where and how I would use it matters.",
    "My electronics purchases seem to have been treated as a broad desire for more electronics, even when the suggested item solves no current problem for me."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "What I already own matters: another streaming stick offers little, while a device that adds a useful home function is more appealing.",
    "Interest does not always mean I would buy now: I would choose the larger smart display over both sizes, and wait on a speaker or HDMI cable until I need one."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The suggestions recognize my connected-home interests but miss the distinction between adding a useful function and buying redundant or unrelated equipment."
}
